WEBVTT

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:30.339
C: Oh, that's rather quixotic of you,

00:01:30.363 --> 00:01:31.815
but I think you should try.

00:01:31.839 --> 00:01:34.064
A: Good. I feel better already.

00:01:34.088 --> 00:01:35.737
C: You're looking a little worse.

00:01:35.761 --> 00:01:39.403
A: Well, might I have that pink rose?

00:01:39.427 --> 00:01:40.578
C: Why?

00:01:40.602 --> 00:01:43.197
A: Because you are
like a pink rose, cousin Cecily.

00:01:43.221 --> 00:01:45.502
C: Well, I don't think
it could be right for you

00:01:45.526 --> 00:01:46.694
to talk to me like that.

00:01:46.718 --> 00:01:49.351
A: You are the prettiest girl I ever saw.

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:52.581
C: But -- well, I -- I --

00:01:52.605 --> 00:01:54.513
A: And, and ahem --

00:01:54.537 --> 00:01:57.616
C: All good looks are a snare and --

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.238
A: Well, it's a snare
that every sensible man